<script setup lang="ts">import type {Finding,Stratification} from '../types/domain';import {dec,pct,labelBin} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{finding:Finding;stratification?:Stratification}>();function stratumLabel(v:string|null){return v==null?'缺失':v}function stratumStatus(v:string){return v==='covered'?'已覆盖':v==='missing_candidate'?'候选缺层':'候选新增层'}</script><template><section class="stratified" v-if="finding.metrics.weighted"><div class="section-title"><h2>语言 × 设备联合分层</h2><small>共用全量参考冻结箱 · 原始总体与加权候选并列</small></div><div class="family-strip"><span>参考层已覆盖 {{stratification?.covered_strata_count??0}} / {{stratification?.reference_strata_count??0}} · 候选新增层 {{stratification?.new_strata.length??0}}</span><span>分层对账：参考 {{stratification?.reconciliation.reference_strata_sum??0}} 层内 + {{stratification?.reconciliation.reference_missing_dimension_rows??0}} 维度缺失 = {{stratification?.reconciliation.reference_total_rows??0}}</span><span>候选 {{stratification?.reconciliation.candidate_strata_sum??0}} 层内 + {{stratification?.reconciliation.candidate_missing_dimension_rows??0}} 维度缺失 = {{stratification?.reconciliation.candidate_total_rows??0}}</span></div><div v-if="stratification&&!stratification.coverage_complete" class="notice error" role="alert">候选缺少参考层，加权分布不可计算；不以零值补齐。缺层与新增层分列于下表。<span>原始总体比较仍照常可用。</span></div><p v-if="finding.metrics.weighted.reason" class="missing-note">{{finding.metrics.weighted.reason}}</p><div class="section-title"><h2>逐层样本与权重</h2><small>层内计数沿用同一冻结箱；未覆盖层不进入加权</small></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>语言</th><th>设备</th><th>层状态</th><th>参考 n</th><th>参考权重</th><th>候选 n</th><th>候选占比</th><th>本层特征缺失 / 参考·候选</th><th>本层加权候选 n</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="s in finding.metrics.weighted.strata" :key="s.key"><td>{{stratumLabel(s.language)}}</td><td>{{stratumLabel(s.device)}}</td><td>{{stratumStatus(s.status)}}</td><td>{{s.reference_n}}</td><td>{{dec(s.reference_weight,4)}}<small v-if="s.excluded_from_weighted">未进入加权</small></td><td>{{s.candidate_n}}</td><td>{{pct(s.candidate_share)}}</td><td>{{s.reference_missing}} / {{s.candidate_missing}}</td><td>{{s.candidate_weighted_counts==null?'—':dec(s.candidate_weighted_counts.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),1)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="missing-note">语言或设备为 null 的片段：参考 {{stratification?.missing_dimension.reference_rows_excluded??0}} / 候选 {{stratification?.missing_dimension.candidate_rows_excluded??0}}，无法归入联合层，不参与加权；不以零值补层。候选新增层 {{stratification?.reconciliation.candidate_rows_in_new_strata??0}} 行同样不进入加权，因为参考没有对应构成。</p><div class="section-title"><h2>原始总体 vs 参考构成加权</h2><small>PSI / JS 仅作效应量参考 · 加权不做显著性检验</small></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>冻结箱</th><th>参考计数</th><th>原始候选计数</th><th>加权候选计数</th><th>参考比例</th><th>原始候选比例</th><th>加权候选比例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(label,i) in finding.metrics.binning.labels" :key="i"><td class="mono">{{labelBin(label)}}</td><td>{{finding.metrics.reference_counts[i]}}</td><td>{{finding.metrics.candidate_counts[i]}}</td><td>{{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_candidate_counts?.[i]==null?'—':dec(finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_candidate_counts[i],2)}}</td><td>{{pct(finding.metrics.reference_proportions[i])}}</td><td>{{pct(finding.metrics.candidate_proportions[i])}}</td><td>{{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_candidate_proportions?.[i]==null?'—':pct(finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_candidate_proportions[i])}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="finding-summary"><div><small>原始总体 PSI / ln</small><b>{{dec(finding.metrics.psi)}}</b></div><div><small>原始总体 JS / log₂</small><b>{{dec(finding.metrics.js)}}</b></div><div><small>加权候选 PSI / ln</small><b>{{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_psi==null?'—':dec(finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_psi)}}</b></div><div><small>加权候选 JS / log₂</small><b>{{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_js==null?'—':dec(finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_js)}}</b></div></div><p class="missing-note">加权只校正语言×设备构成，并与原始总体并列保留。加权候选总样本 {{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_total==null?'—':dec(finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_total,1)}} / 分层参考 {{finding.metrics.weighted.reference_stratified_n}}（对账{{finding.metrics.weighted.total_matches_stratified_reference==null?'未计算':finding.metrics.weighted.total_matches_stratified_reference?'一致':'不一致'}}）；分层参考不含语言或设备缺失的行，故可能与全量参考数不同。加权没有 p/q，也不进入 BH 检验族；FDR 与 KS 仍只针对原始总体。{{finding.feature==='language'||finding.feature==='device'?' 被比较特征本身就是分层维度时，加权会按构造对齐参考边际，加权 PSI/JS 归零属预期，应改读逐层表。':''}}<template v-if="finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_review_suggested!=null"> 加权效应量{{finding.metrics.weighted.weighted_review_suggested?'触及':'未触及'}}PSI≥.2 / JS≥.05 的核对启发阈值，仅为效应量提示，不是显著性结论。</template></p></section></template>
